d but not closed: step 5 (autodeploy.sh:921-930) already established a 200 from /health within the timeout, so a 5c curl failure is likely transient — but the design intends 5c to be conclusive about the request path."],"finding":"The autodeploy handshake gate fails OPEN on any failure of the check itself: `curl ... | python3 -c '...' || echo ok` yields \"ok\" (promote) when curl fails, when /health returns unparseable JSON, or when the `handshake` value is a non-dict (the `.get` at print time raises outside the inner try). The gate's negative result (promote) is thus indistinguishable from 'the check never produced a verdict', so a transient probe failure at 5c promotes a container the gate was meant to scrutinize.","id":"3","impact":0.0,"location":"infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh:971-982","norm_id":"n5b1f117bbe684cca","priority":0.0,"reason":"default-advisory","severity":"none","standing":{"origin_decision":"advisory","origin_revision":"6598b34be0bc94029f99cf9933772f99b27f7e26","state":"still-present"},"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.7143,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","respects_artifact_altitude":"na","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"blast_radius":"local","capability_degraded":false,"churn90":0,"contract_drift":false,"data_loss_without_recovery":false,"dead_code":false,"debt_impact":"low","escapes_automation":true,"forbids_contract_allowed_state":false,"hard_to_reverse_surface":false,"hidden_invariant":false,"implicit_coupling":false,"likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reachable_path_without_automated_coverage":false,"removed_public_symbol":false,"reversibility":"easy","safety_n